{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is closest to 100 on the number line?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d005773e0c7c30b79d772843020bf4d114ab5b0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 98\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 95\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 103\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 107\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can calculate the distance from 100 for each of the numbers, and see which distance is the lowest:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/515e2f3f401492fd940404df80ffd0447f49c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|98 - 100| = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c50b1549513a023418f27da960759cbcd1bb96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|95 - 100| = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/2/822b659e63ad0569064fc4ba31f37c9f3005761e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|103 - 100| = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b6ef38c8c10a8448c634e7c1e7cc7cdd047b54e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|107 - 100| = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6191418e5f9a1dc85a8cc5b862c9d9194f2e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|110 - 100| = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Of the answer choices, the number with the smallest distance to 100 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b6b17e7f48d388e9f7456aa77d96449c7bb61e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can place the numbers on a number line.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>As shown by the number line, the answer choice with the smallest distance to 100 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b6b17e7f48d388e9f7456aa77d96449c7bb61e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <